%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 642a6bab34dcbd842b5b2ec6dbc957e3, type: 3}
  m_Name: demo_map_01
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MapGuide
  mapID: demo_map_01
  mapName: Cinema
  zonesForOnePlayer: 2
  extraZonesPerPlayer: 1
  maxZonesToFinish: 6
  howToWin: "\u2022 The night runs from 00:00 to 06:00. The exits stay locked during
    the night.\n\u2022 Finish the zones you need (goal above). Each zone's TASK BOARD
    shows its lines; take a map from the map box to find your way.\n\u2022 Zones
    done by 06:00 = the EXITS OPEN for one in-game hour. Walk out through an exit.
    Each exit lets only 2 people out, so split up.\n\u2022 Not done by 06:00: if
    2 or more players are dead, the night goes on (overtime) and the ghosts get angrier
    until you finish. If fewer than 2 are dead, you are LOCKED IN for one hour.\n\u2022
    Downed players can be revived by a teammate (hold E). A downed player with a
    switched-on walkie can still call for help on it.\n\u2022 Money = the tasks YOU
    finished. Dying loses the items you brought in."
  zones:
  - name: Tickets
    where: The ticket counter at the front of the cinema.
    tasks: 'Sell tickets until the board''s goal. Each customer needs the right ticket:
      HUMAN ticket for people, GHOST ticket for ghosts. Look at the customer before
      you sell.'
    rules: []
    otherDangers: "Wrong tickets cost sanity and the sale pays nothing; too many
      wrong tickets call a punishing ghost.\nMISSING PARTS GHOST (once a night, 00:00\u201303:00):
      a ghost missing an arm, the head or its body comes to the ticket or popcorn
      counter and blocks it. Press E on it and it follows you. Find its parts inside
      the building, hold a part and hold E on the ghost for 3 s. You have 1 in-game
      hour (countdown above its head). Time up = -25 HP and -25% sanity for everyone
      near it."
  - name: Popcorn & Water
    where: The popcorn and drinks counter next to the ticket counter.
    tasks: Make each customer's order (popcorn flavour + drink) until the board's
      goal. Ghost customers need the SPECIAL INGREDIENT in their food.
    rules: []
    otherDangers: Food for a ghost without the special ingredient = you lose HP and
      sanity. If the special ingredient goes missing, follow its trail, find it and
      bring it back before you serve ghosts again.
  - name: Screen Rooms
    where: 'The two screen rooms in the theatre wing: the normal (human) room and
      the GHOST room.'
    tasks: 'Change the film in the GHOST room at 02:00 and 04:00 (hold E 5 s at the
      projector). Clean the 3 dirt marks in the ghost room after 01:00 (hold E 3
      s).

      Bonus (money only, not needed for the zone): clean the normal room
      and change its film at 00:30 and 02:30.'
    rules:
    - title: No noise
      whatToDo: 'Inside the ghost room, keep quiet: walk slowly, do not sprint, do
        not shout into your mic.'
      ifYouBreakIt: big sanity loss
    - title: Don't look at the audience
      whatToDo: Never look at the ghost customers sitting in the seats.
      ifYouBreakIt: you lose HP every second you look
    - title: The audience stands
      whatToDo: 'If every customer stands up and stares at you: stand still. When
        they sit down again, leave the room at once.'
      ifYouBreakIt: they chase you inside the room
    - title: Staff time (static screen)
      whatToDo: "If the screen turns to TV static and the ghosts vanish: stand on
        the black shadow in the seats within 13 s and stay until the static stops
        (3\u20136 s). One player is enough."
      ifYouBreakIt: a ghost comes out of the screen and roams the whole building
        until 06:00
    otherDangers: 
  - name: Toilets
    where: The men's and women's toilets.
    tasks: 'After 03:00 clean both toilets: 3 dirt marks in each (hold E 3 s).'
    rules:
    - title: Cracked mirror
      whatToDo: If a mirror has a crack, look at the crack for a few seconds.
      ifYouBreakIt: 'it shatters: jumpscare, HP and sanity loss for everyone inside'
    - title: The last stall (women's)
      whatToDo: 'If the last stall is closed and you hear crying: switch the light
        OFF at once and stand still.'
      ifYouBreakIt: a ghost comes out and chases you
    - title: Cigarette smoke (men's)
      whatToDo: 'If smoke comes out of a stall: knock on that stall (E), then switch
        the light OFF.'
      ifYouBreakIt: HP loss for a while and the toilet's tasks are locked
    - title: Ghost food
      whatToDo: 'When the toilet is fully cleaned: light OFF, throw the black box
        into the last stall, then everyone out fast.'
      ifYouBreakIt: ghosts swarm the toilet
    otherDangers: 
  generalTips: "\u2022 Talk to your team: share which rules you saw tonight.\n\u2022
    Keep your flashlight charged; dark rooms hide ghosts.\n\u2022 Low sanity? Hold
    C to chant, or eat a snack.\n\u2022 Carry a walkie: it reaches every teammate
    with a switched-on walkie, and it still works when you are downed."
